ger_methods_argument_skeleton_m7_ets_fixed_specification", "label": "M7 \u2014 The ETS Rung Is One Fixed Specification", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The default information-criterion search selects among specifications on a sample that cannot separate them and adds a second selection step the rolling-origin comparison does not carry; the consequence is stated so a poor showing is not read as evidence against the class."}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_m8_original_gate_had_no_test", "label": "M8 \u2014 The Original Gate Had No Test, Not a Weak One", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At six origins and a seven-day horizon the correction factor's numerator is exactly zero, so no corrected statistic is computable on any data whatsoever."}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_m9_conformal_substitution_counted", "label": "M9 \u2014 The Conformal Substitution Is Counted, Not Silent", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An unbounded interval is useless to an operator deciding whether a day is normal; a guarantee that lapsed silently would lapse first on exactly the thinnest groups, so every band below the attainable size is tallied beside the coverage it qualifies."}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_m10_mondrian_observed_partition", "label": "M10 \u2014 The Mondrian Partition Is an Observed Calendar Variable", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_m11_cusum_constants_do_not_transplant", "label": "M11 \u2014 CUSUM's Textbook Constants Do Not Transplant", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The tables are derived for a statistic standardised by a standard deviation, while the detector divides by a conformal half-width; restandardising to recover the tables was also rejected, because it would decouple the detector from the interval whose coverage the design establishes."}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_m12_saturated_first_stage", "label": "M12 \u2014 The Saturated First Stage Is an Estimator", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "What is forgone is covariates, not estimation: the closed form reaches the same fitted probabilities by a route that exists, while the coefficient MLE does not under complete separation."}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_m13_occurrence_untestable", "label": "M13 \u2014 Ellel's Occurrence Gate Reported Untestable, Not Approximated", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deriving occurrence from Ellel's own trading days is circular \u2014 it uses the target to build the covariate \u2014 and is made impossible rather than discouraged: the diary function takes no revenue parameter and a test asserts no such branch exists."}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_m14_recall_upper_bound", "label": "M14 \u2014 Detection Recall on the Control Corpus Is an Upper Bound", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "That corpus splices perturbed test rows onto unperturbed training rows so the forecaster never sees the perturbation, while production refits weekly, refits on a confirmed change point and recalibrates on rolling blocks, all three absorbing a sustained shift."}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_prose_only_derivations", "label": "Nine Derivations Existing Only in the Live Prose", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_compression_confirmation", "label": "Confirmation After Composition \u2014 Two Compressions Named", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every derivation survives; the two compressed to a single sentence are named so the compression is visible rather than silent."}, {"id": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_colliding_a_namespaces", "label": "The Colliding A-Namespaces and the Structural Fix", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/ledger/methods_argument_skeleton.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Both readings were correct in their own file; the hazard is a session resolving one in the wrong table, which silently swaps one derivation for another."}], "edges": [{"source": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_methods_argument_skeleton", "target": "brain_ledger_methods_argument_skeleton_m1_ellel_unscaled_estimand", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confide